      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There is established in the Office of the Mayor, the Model Cities Committee which shall consist of the Director of City Planning, who shall be chairman; the Director of the Budget; and four other members who shall be designated by the Mayor and shall serve at his pleasure.",
